# ---- RC 2026-08-24 cleanup (CLAUDE.md: "Only source files belong in git
# repo, never binaries, tables etc.").  All of these stay ON DISK; they are
# untracked with `git rm --cached`, never deleted.
# NOTE: .gitignore has NO trailing-comment syntax -- a pattern written as
# "*.png   # figures" is taken LITERALLY and matches nothing.  Comments must
# be on their own line.  (Got this wrong first time, 2026-08-24.)
#
# 157 derived figures, 21 MB; no tracked .md references any of them
*.png
